1
00:00:00,810 --> 00:00:03,040
(Leonard:)Well,
Sheldon always has his pants on.

2
00:00:03,045 --> 00:00:05,715
(Amy:)I don't think I could
pick his knees out of a lineup.

3
00:00:06,916 --> 00:00:08,046
(Penny:)Well, it's not
just the pants.

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,420
(Penny:)Just, it's like since
we got married,

5
00:00:09,418 --> 00:00:11,118
(Penny:)he doesn't really
try anymore.

6
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,590
Uh, Penny?

7
00:00:12,588 --> 00:00:13,858
(Amy:)I don't know how to say this,

8
00:00:13,856 --> 00:00:15,786
(Amy:)but this is
my first girls' night

9
00:00:15,791 --> 00:00:17,921
(Amy:)and you're kind of
bumming everybody out.

10
00:00:21,797 --> 00:00:24,197
(Howard:)All right, got Halley to sleep.

11
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,900
(Raj:)Yeah, I heard you
on the baby monitor.

12
00:00:25,901 --> 00:00:28,171
(Raj:)Didn't think you could
turn the theme from Walking Dead

13
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:30,100
(Raj:)into a lullaby.

14
00:00:31,207 --> 00:00:33,337
(Howard:)Yeah, got to get her
hooked on TV,

15
00:00:33,342 --> 00:00:36,042
(Howard:)or someday,
she'll want me to play outside.

16
00:00:36,846 --> 00:00:39,546
(Howard:)Boy, that floor is so squeaky.

17
00:00:39,548 --> 00:00:42,548
(Howard:)I'm surprised I didn't wake
her up walking out of the room.

18
00:00:42,551 --> 00:00:44,251
(Raj:)Have you tried anything
to fix it?

19
00:00:44,253 --> 00:00:46,083
(Howard:)Well, I put the rug down.

20
00:00:46,088 --> 00:00:47,188
(Howard:)It didn't help.

21
00:00:47,189 --> 00:00:49,889
(Raj:)I know. Blue shag.
What were you thinking?

22
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:55,330
(Howard:)Did try nailing a couple
of the boards down.

23
00:00:55,331 --> 00:00:56,401
(Raj:)Did that do anything?

24
00:00:56,398 --> 00:00:58,028
(Howard:)Yeah, it left little
holes in the floor,

25
00:00:58,033 --> 00:01:07,023
(Howard:)that's why I
bought the rug.

